{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく更新してなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校が休みで一日中寝てたら\n逆にだるくなってしまって...\nでも！元気です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んだけど...みんな～\nなんだよなんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してコメントしてくださってる\nのに別に心配してないよなんて...\nまーたツンツンして～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...はい。\n心配おかけしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに前回の質問回答で\nまりかのブログ読んだら\n元気になるよとか自分で言っといて\nその次の日に更新してなくて\nなんだかごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑長い！めんどくさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスドで一番好きな種類は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポンデリング！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリだとどんな感じで\n写るのかな♪( ´▽｀)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものっそいケバケバしく\n写ってる気がする。\n目がワッて！ワッてなってる！\n最近のプリクラすごいんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エッグスンに行きたいと\n思ってるんだけど、あそこって\n予約して行った方がいいのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予約してないよー！\n早朝並んで入ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日まで後１ヶ月だね\n何か欲しいものある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。\n誕生日の3日前に握手会があるなんて\nもうわくわくです♪\nその気持ちだけで私はじゅうぶん\n嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体を柔らかくする方法\n教えてくださーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂上がりにストレッチが\nいちばん効果あると思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく握手会行けそうに\nないんだけど待っててくれる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってますよー♪いつでも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二十歳になったらまず何したい？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堂々と大人だもんと叫ぶ\n～だもんはイタイか...←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気合い入れるときに\n必ずすることってなぁに？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る前はいつもより\n念入りにストレッチや\nマッサージする！とか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキーやったことある～？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔やったことある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真を集めてるファンって\nどう思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ嬉しいですよ！\nだって撮影の時メンバーみんな\n気合入れて撮ってるからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に行っても万理華が\n可愛すぎて直視できません(´・ω・`)\nどうすればいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガン見してやるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じいいいいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服を買うときに選ぶ基準に\nしてることはありますか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の持ってる服に合わせて\n買ってるよ。\n今着れてもこの先も着れるか...\nとかじっくり選ぶ派なのよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装する予定（？）はある？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないよー\n私が男装なんて似合わないだろうな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れな、いくちゃん♡2013.1.22"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう♪\nかわいくてしっかり者\n2人ともだいすきよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなは最近りんちゃん呼びが\n復活しつつあります笑\nりんちゃんて呼んだときの反応が\nかわいいったらもう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんにはよくダル絡みを\nしようとすると避けられますが\nあきらめてません笑\n天然で騙そうとしないでね♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「...近々苔を育てようかしら。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だるくなった体を戻そうと思い、\n部屋で軽く踊ってたまりっかでした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/23/4349890/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}